<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s225S">The <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s225w1">first</span> of these positions belongs to a <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s225w3">certain</span> group within the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s225w2">Mind-Only School</span>. The <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s225w4">second</span> position is <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s225w8">explained</span> <span class="u case" data-d="6" data-l="s225w7">by</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s225w6">Master Avalokitavrata</span> to be that of the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s225w5">Detailist School</span>--of a certain section <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s225w12">other than</span> the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s225w9"><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s225w10">Kashmiri</span> <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s225w11">Detailists</span></span>. The <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s225w13">third</span> position <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s225w14">also</span> belongs to a specific <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s225w16">group</span> within the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s225w15">Detailist School</span>. It is <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s225w19">not</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s225w18">completely clear</span> where the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s225w17">fourth</span> position belongs, <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s225w20">but</span> since it is <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s225w25">consistent</span> with the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s225w24">ninth</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s225w23">chapter</span> of the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s225w22">autocommentary</span> to the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s225w21">Treasure House of Knowledge (Abhidharmakosha)</span>, it <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s225w32">would appear to be</span> an alternate <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s225w31">belief</span> of the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s225w26">Sutrists</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s225w27">and</span> the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s225w28"><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s225w29">Kashmiri</span> <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s225w30">Detailists</span></span>.</span>
</div>
